; Test: Basic facts
; Coverage: fact assertion, multiple facts, negated facts
; All facts should appear as both +D (definitely provable) and +d (defeasibly provable)

(given bird)
(given penguin)
(given (not swims))

; EXPECT: +D bird
; EXPECT: +d bird
; EXPECT: +D penguin
; EXPECT: +d penguin
; EXPECT: +D ~swims
; EXPECT: +d ~swims
